THM3869_IDENTITY Delta=(x+1)^3*ell^2-q^2;P^3-Q^2=Delta*ell^4
THM3869_DIRECTION h=h1-4(x+1);same seminormal class,not fourth
THM3869_COMPLEMENT F^2-a^3*ell^2=(1-a)^3*(9a-4)^2;nonsquare 1-a blocks peel
THM3869_CUBIC irreducible S3;Newton slope -2/3 at ell
THM3869_DISCRIMINANTS power=108*Delta*ell^4;maximal=field=108*Delta*ell^2
THM3869_RAMIFICATION Delta:(2,1);ell:e=3;Kummer valuations=(4,2)
THM3869_INDEX_FORM ell*u^3-3*(x+1)*ell*u*v^2+2*q*v^3;ideal=(ell,q)
THM3869_SHIFT_SCOUT trace and scalar (c,d) shifts do not remove ell
THM3869_SCOPE explicit nonmonogenic near-miss; nonlinear shifts/atlas/JC2 open
